      "name": "GET: SOCIAL BOOKING DATA",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 5,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "googleApi": {
          "id": "uK8ukluJTR2q9zC7",
          "name": "km-tin-social-booking"
        }
      },
      "notes": "retrieve the data\n\nif ready_status is approved \nAND\nif transfer_status is not transferred"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        736,
        0
      ],
      "id": "c3ced050-6ee3-4f6e-b247-11a0e77700dc",
      "name": "LOOP"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst results = [];\n\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const data = item.json;\n  const isEmpty = Object.keys(data).length === 0;\n\n  if (isEmpty) {\n    // ID doesn't exist yet → pull data from \"REATE AN ID AND IMPORTANT FIELD\" node\n    const editFieldsData = $('IMPORTANT FIELD').first().json;\n\n    results.push({\n      json: {\n        ...editFieldsData,\n        id_exist: false\n      }\n    });\n  } else {\n    // ID already exists → keep data from previous node, just flag it\n    results.push({\n      json: {\n        ...data,\n        id_exist: true\n      }\n    });\n  }\n}\n\nreturn results;"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1840,
        16
      ],
      "id": "a4fbef3e-d795-4470-8156-da443a82ec3d",
      "name": "CHECK ID EXISTENCE",
      "notes": "Object.keys(data).length === 0 checks if the incoming item is {} (your \"id doesn't exist\" case).\n\nIf empty → it fetches the item(s) from the node named \"REATE AN ID AND IMPORTANT FIELD\" using $('Edit Fields').first().json, spreads that data, and adds id_exist: false.\n\nIf not empty → it spreads the existing data from the previous node and adds id_exist: true."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
