      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Documentation\n\n* This workflow will run every 15 minutes.\n\n* Retrieve data from the Social Booking tab where \n`ready_status` is **Approved** and `transfer_status` is **Not Transferred**.\n\n* Check if the ID already exists in the Locked Ads tab. If it exists, ignore it; otherwise, proceed.\n\n* Transfer the data from the Social Booking tab to the Locked Ads tab.\n\n* Update the `transfer_status` in the Social Booking tab to **Transferred**.\n\n* Notify David about the newly transferred data.\n",
